  "titleZh": "女主角武器特效",
  "description": "Hero girl weapon FX (water/sling/bubble/lightning/frost/flame). v0.27 folds the v0.22 projectile remake: fx-water-proj, fx-sling-knockback, fx-flame-cone-short, fx-flame-burn, fx-frost-freeze. v0.31 adds profession water body-hit overlays plus clearer fx-water-splash-big and fx-water-wet-ground. v0.32 adds stone/pebble sling body-hit overlays (fx-hit-sling-*). v0.32.1 replaces fx-sling-pellet, fx-sling-impact, and those hit overlays with brighter sheets after a Tester Conditional Fail (invisible pellet on asphalt, faint hit on the body). v0.35.2 adds fx-slash as a side-crescent spare only (not the feel-booth melee primary). v0.35.3 adds fx-slash-overhead, deprecated as the feel melee primary: PNG kept, reserved unused spare, not feel-booth 4. v0.35.4 adds fx-slash-ninja, the feel-booth 4 primary melee: Fruit Ninja thin straight diagonal TL→BR, pure white / light gray, 5×96 @ 30 fps, ADD, origin center, spawn on the target body center. Legacy water FX stay. v1.0 catalogs the water Mega Man charge pack beside them: fx-water-proj-t2, fx-water-proj-t3, fx-water-charge-aura, fx-water-t2-impact, fx-water-t2-dot, fx-water-t3-impact, fx-water-t3-path-burn, and fx-water-t3-inbullet-dot. v2.0 replaces fx-water-proj-t2 on the same key and path (west 8-frame 128×64 strip @ 12 fps) and adds fx-aoe-touch-x (4-frame 32×32 strip, once @ 16 fps). r2 keeps fx-water-charge-aura as the blue/cyan 48×48 8f@10 cue while charging toward L2, and adds yellow fx-water-charge-aura-l2 (≥2.5s) and red fx-water-charge-aura-l3 (≥5s). fx-water-proj-t3 is v3.0, a west 8-frame 512×256 strip @ 10 fps (sheet 4096×256). fx-water-t2-aoe is v2.0, a 6×5 grid of 256×212, 30 frames @ 8 fps (sheet 1536×1060). The group thumb omits those two large sheets so the montage stays under 1600px; catalog cards still play them. Stage combat is unchanged. fx-water-proj (L1) stays. No pierce-impact sheet.",
